  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protecting Areas Matter - Advocating for Nature Conservation in Albania - PAMANCA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project&apos;s aim is the enhancing of the decision-making processes, monitor conservation efforts, and strengthen stakeholder cooperation alignment with the overall goal of empowering civil society to actively participate and influence policy and reforms, particularly in environmental and biodiversity protection which is one of the priority areas of the call. The project&#xBF;s focus is to challenge biodiversity degradation and enhance the protection of biodiversity in Albania&#xBF;s protected areas. The thematic priority of increasing public awareness and behavioural change towards biodiversity conservation is particularly relevant, as it directly contributes to the program&#xBF;s objective of promoting sustainable environmental practices and engagement with policy processes at both local and national levels. Implemented by the Center for the Protection of Natural Ecosystems in Albania - EcoAlbania&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
